  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program Childhood Care</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Atencin para la Niez</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT FOR: (1) THE FORMULATION OF POLICIES FOR CHILDHOOD CARE THROUGH BASIC STUDIES, AND INSTITUTIONAL SUPPORT TO THE NATIONAL COMMISSION FOR THE PROMOTION AND DEFENSE OF CHILDREN&apos;S RIGHTS; AND (2) SUPPORT TO COMMUNITY CHILDHOOD DEVELOPMENT CENTERS, STRENGTHENING OF THE NICARAGUAN FUND FOR CHILDREN AND FAMILIES (FONIF) IN PROJECT ADMINISTRATION AND SUPERVISON, AND EVALUATION AND MONITORING THE IMPACT OF THE PROJECTS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
